{"type":"utterance","id":"121-121726-0005","text":"Hange Fence.","audio_seconds":3.1,"processing_seconds":2.945,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[5],"mel_ms":[1282.811],"encode_ms":[497.872],"decode_ms":[1127.164]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1837-0021","text":"The hope and dream of harvest was upon the land.","audio_seconds":3.09,"processing_seconds":2.429,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1024.843],"encode_ms":[447.146],"decode_ms":[950.014]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0050","text":"I really don't think he knew much about it, Mr. Holmes.","audio_seconds":3.085,"processing_seconds":2.566,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[21],"mel_ms":[1022.653],"encode_ms":[449.544],"decode_ms":[1087.411]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-81414-0026","text":"My overwrought nerves yielded at last.","audio_seconds":3.075,"processing_seconds":2.529,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1079.983],"encode_ms":[456.747],"decode_ms":[986.192]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0034","text":"Thank you, he returned shortly.","audio_seconds":3.075,"processing_seconds":2.467,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1056.759],"encode_ms":[453.829],"decode_ms":[950.979]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0014","text":"Are you certain that this is the Mediterranean?","audio_seconds":3.07,"processing_seconds":2.572,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1094.718],"encode_ms":[468.06],"decode_ms":[1002.877]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0016","text":"Oh, I know. That's Lauren Brandon.","audio_seconds":3.06,"processing_seconds":2.624,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1122.138],"encode_ms":[483.405],"decode_ms":[1011.778]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0026","text":"Surely you are not thinking of going off there.","audio_seconds":3.05,"processing_seconds":2.726,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1158.054],"encode_ms":[490.937],"decode_ms":[1070.184]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0008","text":"Mother, I am going to study medicine.","audio_seconds":3.04,"processing_seconds":2.672,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1155.015],"encode_ms":[484.662],"decode_ms":[1025.913]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0065","text":"Now that two is over.","audio_seconds":3.03,"processing_seconds":2.666,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[7],"mel_ms":[1149.35],"encode_ms":[477.871],"decode_ms":[1032.168]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0042","text":"The world brands this a pernicious doctrine.","audio_seconds":3.02,"processing_seconds":2.812,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1151.374],"encode_ms":[477.602],"decode_ms":[1175.942]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0045","text":"Oh, sir, don't mention it, said Mrs. Poiser.","audio_seconds":3.005,"processing_seconds":3.066,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1262.821],"encode_ms":[519.85],"decode_ms":[1275.856]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0027","text":"That is true, badgree.","audio_seconds":3,"processing_seconds":2.886,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1262.926],"encode_ms":[517.311],"decode_ms":[1099.081]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0029","text":"I want to get away from it all. Swoon.","audio_seconds":2.985,"processing_seconds":3.011,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1325.283],"encode_ms":[535.644],"decode_ms":[1143.066]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0041","text":"It is unintelligible in the dark.","audio_seconds":2.975,"processing_seconds":2.988,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1326.59],"encode_ms":[542.287],"decode_ms":[1112.265]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0034","text":"It seems the king will not consent to it.","audio_seconds":2.965,"processing_seconds":3.157,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1330.471],"encode_ms":[540.69],"decode_ms":[1279.178]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0021","text":"I thank him and take my leave.","audio_seconds":2.96,"processing_seconds":3.196,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[11],"mel_ms":[1397.597],"encode_ms":[597.574],"decode_ms":[1195.031]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0053","text":"They were so extremely curious.","audio_seconds":2.955,"processing_seconds":3.273,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1449.11],"encode_ms":[607.021],"decode_ms":[1209.942]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0018","text":"We'll deal with them later. What do you think?","audio_seconds":2.945,"processing_seconds":3.543,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1602.001],"encode_ms":[659.539],"decode_ms":[1274.585]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5105-28240-0010","text":"Captain Servadac hastened toward him.","audio_seconds":2.935,"processing_seconds":3.584,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1547.517],"encode_ms":[659.817],"decode_ms":[1369.01]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4507-16021-0019","text":"It is the language of wretchedness.","audio_seconds":2.93,"processing_seconds":3.647,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1631.231],"encode_ms":[677.426],"decode_ms":[1330.569]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4077-13751-0019","text":"Who began the quarrel? Was it the Mormons?","audio_seconds":2.92,"processing_seconds":3.599,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1610.745],"encode_ms":[653.431],"decode_ms":[1326.891]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0036","text":"He took her roughly in his arms. Do you know what I mean?","audio_seconds":2.905,"processing_seconds":3.912,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1715.471],"encode_ms":[689.725],"decode_ms":[1496.969]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0008","text":"Some others too. Big Cotton County.","audio_seconds":2.895,"processing_seconds":3.834,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1711.758],"encode_ms":[684.652],"decode_ms":[1429.47]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0050","text":"May you drink heartsies from it for many years?","audio_seconds":2.885,"processing_seconds":3.864,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1714.411],"encode_ms":[691.764],"decode_ms":[1449.387]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0064","text":"How may we obtain remission of our sins?","audio_seconds":2.88,"processing_seconds":3.889,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1715.86],"encode_ms":[695.632],"decode_ms":[1467.628]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0003","text":"In the meantime, I had formed a new idea of her.","audio_seconds":2.865,"processing_seconds":4.05,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1842.766],"encode_ms":[727.345],"decode_ms":[1471.158]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0019","text":"He dropped a handful into her lap.","audio_seconds":2.86,"processing_seconds":4.025,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1838.084],"encode_ms":[735.931],"decode_ms":[1442.668]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0010","text":"She sent me the pages in question before she died.","audio_seconds":2.85,"processing_seconds":4.112,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1864.04],"encode_ms":[728.323],"decode_ms":[1509.036]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7176-92135-0027","text":"Lady Larksburg starts suddenly and turns toward him.","audio_seconds":2.835,"processing_seconds":4.222,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1849.139],"encode_ms":[734.069],"decode_ms":[1629.493]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0026","text":"She's going to put the ironing things away.","audio_seconds":2.825,"processing_seconds":4.082,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1851.854],"encode_ms":[736.932],"decode_ms":[1484.293]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0004","text":"Yes, why not thought Anders?","audio_seconds":2.805,"processing_seconds":4.068,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1838.797],"encode_ms":[733.171],"decode_ms":[1485.98]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0042","text":"Montfichet called out for Robin to give him an arm.","audio_seconds":2.785,"processing_seconds":4.159,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[19],"mel_ms":[1837.057],"encode_ms":[732.288],"decode_ms":[1579.045]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32865-0002","text":"He had his hand upon Lake's shoulder.","audio_seconds":2.78,"processing_seconds":4.064,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1853.742],"encode_ms":[730.844],"decode_ms":[1470.384]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"121-127105-0018","text":"Cried the ladies, whose departure had been fixed.","audio_seconds":2.77,"processing_seconds":4.102,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1835.054],"encode_ms":[732.479],"decode_ms":[1524.63]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7127-75947-0030","text":"She was here just now, said the Count.","audio_seconds":2.76,"processing_seconds":4.025,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1833.36],"encode_ms":[732.925],"decode_ms":[1450.908]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0010","text":"I never had any family.","audio_seconds":2.755,"processing_seconds":4.021,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[8],"mel_ms":[1847.499],"encode_ms":[725.661],"decode_ms":[1440.002]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0023","text":"All the furniture belonged to other times.","audio_seconds":2.745,"processing_seconds":4.093,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1827.298],"encode_ms":[739.185],"decode_ms":[1517.812]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0043","text":"The top floor belongs to Miles McLaren.","audio_seconds":2.74,"processing_seconds":4.25,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1880.647],"encode_ms":[728.188],"decode_ms":[1632.064]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0019","text":"And then there was Broad Street.","audio_seconds":2.725,"processing_seconds":4.047,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1845.112],"encode_ms":[731.199],"decode_ms":[1462.666]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-36377-0012","text":"Make acquaintance with Mr. Yago. Sit together.","audio_seconds":2.715,"processing_seconds":4.206,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[20],"mel_ms":[1828.849],"encode_ms":[730.454],"decode_ms":[1637.31]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7729-102255-0034","text":"To their sorrow, they were soon undeceived.","audio_seconds":2.71,"processing_seconds":4.088,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1846.674],"encode_ms":[725.832],"decode_ms":[1506.964]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4992-23283-0001","text":"Miss Milner's health is not good.","audio_seconds":2.71,"processing_seconds":4.19,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1849.349],"encode_ms":[734.661],"decode_ms":[1598.285]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1284-1181-0021","text":"Asked the voice in scornful accents.","audio_seconds":2.7,"processing_seconds":4.116,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1881.182],"encode_ms":[726.949],"decode_ms":[1500.027]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-76324-0010","text":"What in the world is it? Query Joyce.","audio_seconds":2.69,"processing_seconds":4.271,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1848.525],"encode_ms":[732.209],"decode_ms":[1681.506]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2830-3980-0015","text":"For a person to possess knowledge is not enough.","audio_seconds":2.685,"processing_seconds":4.034,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1838.552],"encode_ms":[732.138],"decode_ms":[1454.765]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"672-122797-0062","text":"No, said the tree.","audio_seconds":2.675,"processing_seconds":4.11,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[7],"mel_ms":[1843.494],"encode_ms":[730.813],"decode_ms":[1527.843]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0011","text":"She found the door, but it was locked outside.","audio_seconds":2.665,"processing_seconds":4.129,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[17],"mel_ms":[1832.311],"encode_ms":[727.862],"decode_ms":[1560.101]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0019","text":"Comb the wool for the Widows indeed.","audio_seconds":2.66,"processing_seconds":4.194,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1845.371],"encode_ms":[727.457],"decode_ms":[1612.79]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0028","text":"There was no man, sir.","audio_seconds":2.655,"processing_seconds":4.022,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[8],"mel_ms":[1845.755],"encode_ms":[730.518],"decode_ms":[1437.672]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0004","text":"And what through the left hand windows?","audio_seconds":2.64,"processing_seconds":4.121,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1844.887],"encode_ms":[725.567],"decode_ms":[1542.611]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5142-33396-0017","text":"We ate at many men's tables uninvited.","audio_seconds":2.635,"processing_seconds":4.137,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1842.335],"encode_ms":[731.627],"decode_ms":[1554.117]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0035","text":"He could examine the papers in his own office.","audio_seconds":2.63,"processing_seconds":4.19,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1852.724],"encode_ms":[729.281],"decode_ms":[1599.738]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0044","text":"Don't cry, don't cry, he whispered.","audio_seconds":2.615,"processing_seconds":4.26,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1881.718],"encode_ms":[731.642],"decode_ms":[1638.148]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"3729-6852-0015","text":"At your service, sir.","audio_seconds":2.61,"processing_seconds":4.063,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[7],"mel_ms":[1848.096],"encode_ms":[730.914],"decode_ms":[1476.006]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2271-0015","text":"A little attack of nerves, possibly.","audio_seconds":2.595,"processing_seconds":4.156,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1855.749],"encode_ms":[727.695],"decode_ms":[1563.565]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141083-0028","text":"Then he tossed it down and seized the next.","audio_seconds":2.585,"processing_seconds":4.13,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[16],"mel_ms":[1859.923],"encode_ms":[733.643],"decode_ms":[1528.127]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0042","text":"Then all our good times are over.","audio_seconds":2.575,"processing_seconds":4.081,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1839.116],"encode_ms":[726.626],"decode_ms":[1507.845]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0062","text":"I am showing you some pretty tricks.","audio_seconds":2.555,"processing_seconds":4.154,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1851.32],"encode_ms":[724.749],"decode_ms":[1569.853]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0017","text":"Rest and be still until I warn you.","audio_seconds":2.55,"processing_seconds":4.253,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1841.391],"encode_ms":[729.875],"decode_ms":[1672.947]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6930-81414-0025","text":"My position was too terrible.","audio_seconds":2.53,"processing_seconds":4.135,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1854.322],"encode_ms":[733.699],"decode_ms":[1539.285]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8455-210777-0054","text":"The letter ran as follows.","audio_seconds":2.52,"processing_seconds":4.004,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1832.55],"encode_ms":[727.58],"decode_ms":[1435.416]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0014","text":"I can't stand seeing you miserable.","audio_seconds":2.51,"processing_seconds":4.087,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1850.143],"encode_ms":[725.882],"decode_ms":[1503.43]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0014","text":"She passed.","audio_seconds":2.5,"processing_seconds":4.104,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[5],"mel_ms":[1862.631],"encode_ms":[726.934],"decode_ms":[1507.17]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-79759-0001","text":"That is comparatively nothing.","audio_seconds":2.48,"processing_seconds":4.069,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1838.722],"encode_ms":[730.772],"decode_ms":[1491.749]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1995-1826-0006","text":"Been looking up Toombs County.","audio_seconds":2.4550625,"processing_seconds":4.121,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1834.355],"encode_ms":[729.373],"decode_ms":[1549]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8463-294828-0005","text":"Conseil was my man's servant.","audio_seconds":2.44,"processing_seconds":4.249,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[11],"mel_ms":[1847.33],"encode_ms":[731.023],"decode_ms":[1663.258]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-292519-0014","text":"She was alone that night.","audio_seconds":2.435,"processing_seconds":4.021,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1834.154],"encode_ms":[724.551],"decode_ms":[1454.526]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0021","text":"I was afraid it was near her home.","audio_seconds":2.425,"processing_seconds":4.212,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[13],"mel_ms":[1865.043],"encode_ms":[736.603],"decode_ms":[1602.081]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70968-0018","text":"So I did push this fellow.","audio_seconds":2.405,"processing_seconds":4.059,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1848.971],"encode_ms":[729.729],"decode_ms":[1472.778]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"6829-68771-0017","text":"The housekeeper led the way, and Beth followed.","audio_seconds":2.39,"processing_seconds":4.19,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1851.72],"encode_ms":[735.317],"decode_ms":[1594.375]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0040","text":"I didn't preach without direction.","audio_seconds":2.385,"processing_seconds":4.126,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1841.767],"encode_ms":[731.659],"decode_ms":[1545.104]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5639-40744-0009","text":"Mother, dear father, do you hear me?","audio_seconds":2.375,"processing_seconds":4.091,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[15],"mel_ms":[1866.053],"encode_ms":[725.801],"decode_ms":[1489.709]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29095-0015","text":"If I can get patience.","audio_seconds":2.36,"processing_seconds":4.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1879.531],"encode_ms":[733.339],"decode_ms":[1499.159]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"1580-141084-0046","text":"Have I told the truth, Mr. Gilchrist?","audio_seconds":2.35,"processing_seconds":4.243,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[18],"mel_ms":[1848.913],"encode_ms":[731.753],"decode_ms":[1653.247]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"5683-32866-0026","text":"I boldly lighted my chirux.","audio_seconds":2.34,"processing_seconds":4.132,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[12],"mel_ms":[1855.405],"encode_ms":[740.739],"decode_ms":[1527.593]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"61-70970-0006","text":"Never that, sir, he had said.","audio_seconds":2.335,"processing_seconds":4.069,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[10],"mel_ms":[1854.602],"encode_ms":[733.417],"decode_ms":[1473.838]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4446-2275-0018","text":"I get nothing but misery out of either.","audio_seconds":2.315,"processing_seconds":4.12,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[14],"mel_ms":[1861.726],"encode_ms":[726.405],"decode_ms":[1523.606]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"7021-85628-0014","text":"He only shook his head.","audio_seconds":2.295,"processing_seconds":4.115,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[8],"mel_ms":[1869.655],"encode_ms":[742.212],"decode_ms":[1495.36]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"8555-284447-0012","text":"The captain shook his head.","audio_seconds":2.275,"processing_seconds":4.092,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1854.357],"encode_ms":[730.889],"decode_ms":[1499.335]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"2094-142345-0016","text":"Spinning indeed.","audio_seconds":2.26,"processing_seconds":4.129,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[6],"mel_ms":[1851.871],"encode_ms":[736.284],"decode_ms":[1532.036]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-126133-0020","text":"How did her mother ever let her go?","audio_seconds":2.24,"processing_seconds":4.067,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[11],"mel_ms":[1843.266],"encode_ms":[733.566],"decode_ms":[1482.831]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"4970-29093-0016","text":"No, that's interesting.","audio_seconds":2.23,"processing_seconds":4.484,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1855.865],"encode_ms":[726.55],"decode_ms":[1893.735]}
{"type":"utterance","id":"237-134500-0004","text":"That invitation decided her.","audio_seconds":2.225,"processing_seconds":4.1,"windows":1,"empty_windows":0,"tokens":[9],"mel_ms":[1847.644],"encode_ms":[734.652],"decode_ms":[1510.088]}
